{"term":"necklace","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:c7059aaf38d61674c6","definition":"An article of jewelry that is worn around the neck, most often made of a string of precious metal, pearls, gems, beads or shells, and sometimes having a pendant attached.","example":"","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["anodyne necklace","Casal's necklace","Colombian necklace","coral necklace","necklacelike","necklace poplar","necklacer","necklace tree","pearl necklace","sea necklace"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/necklace#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:af41405770b6bd9fd5","definition":"Anything resembling a necklace in shape.","example":"a necklace of coral islands","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"figuratively","register":"figuratively","wordFamily":["anodyne necklace","Casal's necklace","Colombian necklace","coral necklace","necklacelike","necklace poplar","necklacer","necklace tree","pearl necklace","sea necklace"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/necklace#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:7b403606abe5a94d33","definition":"A device used in necklacing (an informal execution); a rubber tyre that is filled with petrol. It is placed around the victim's chest and arms, and set on fire.","example":"Necklacing on Wikipedia.Wikipedia","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"South-Africa","register":"South-Africa","wordFamily":["anodyne necklace","Casal's necklace","Colombian necklace","coral necklace","necklacelike","necklace poplar","necklacer","necklace tree","pearl necklace","sea necklace"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/necklace#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:5ae320aeb2e732405e","definition":"To informally execute by necklacing; by setting on fire a petrol-filled rubber tyre which has been put around the bound victim's neck.","example":"Frustrated residents tied the hands of two suspected criminals, put tyres around their necks and then set them alight. In a manifestation of growing disillusionment with the criminal justice system, residents of Bramfischerville, west of Johannesburg, on Tuesday abducted and necklaced two suspected burglars.","pos":"verb","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"South-Africa","register":"South-Africa","wordFamily":["anodyne necklace","Casal's necklace","Colombian necklace","coral necklace","necklacelike","necklace poplar","necklacer","necklace tree","pearl necklace","sea necklace"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/necklace#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ipa":"/ˈnɛkləs/"},"wordFamily":["anodyne necklace","Casal's necklace","Colombian necklace","coral necklace","necklacelike","necklace poplar","necklacer","necklace tree","pearl necklace","sea necklace"]}